
@TodoApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7018

### Get all todos
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/Todos
Accept: application/json

### Add a todo
POST https://localhost:7018/api/Todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Complete Todo Application",
    "description": "Finish the assignment",
    "priority": "High",
    "category": "Work",
    "isCompleted": false
}


### Search and filter todos
GET https://localhost:7018/api/Todos/search?search=Complete&priority=High&category=Work
Accept: application/json

GET https://localhost:7018/api/Todos/999

### Test missing Todo
GET https://localhost:7018/api/Todos/999
Accept: application/json

### Get Todo by ID
GET https://localhost:7018/api/Todos/1
Accept: application/json

### Get missing Todo
GET https://localhost:7018/api/Todos/999
Accept: application/json

### Create a new Todo
POST https://localhost:7018/api/Todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare React Frontend",
  "description": "Build the Todo application UI",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "category": "Personal",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### Verify created Todo
GET https://localhost:7018/api/Todos
Accept: application/json


### Update Todo
PUT https://localhost:7018/api/Todos/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "title": "Prepare React Frontend - Updated",
  "description": "Build and test the Todo application UI",
  "priority": "High",
  "category": "Personal",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### Verify updated Todo
GET https://localhost:7018/api/Todos/2
Accept: application/json

### Delete Todo
DELETE https://localhost:7018/api/Todos/2